Template: neuraldisk/install-ollama
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Install Ollama for NeuralDisk's AI copilot?
 NeuralDisk includes an optional AI copilot that talks to a local Ollama
 server. Every other feature (all of the scanning tools) works fully
 without it. If you agree, this will run Ollama's own official install
 script (curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh). You can always
 install it yourself later from https://ollama.com instead.

Template: neuraldisk/pull-model
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Download the default AI model (llama3.1, about 4.7 GB)?
 This will run in the background after the package finishes installing and
 may take a while depending on your connection. You can always run
 'ollama pull llama3.1' yourself later instead.
